        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "43. If another job is offered to an employee and the employee refuses to accept such new job, he/she may be terminated immediately or at the end of the notification period at the discretion of the Employer and shall receive severance pay on the following basis for full years of continuous service as a Regular employee; provided that the straight-time hourly rate of pay for the new job offered the employee was at least fifteen cents ($0.15) per hour less than the regular straight-time hourly rate of pay assigned the job currently being performed by the employee.",
